<title>TUNISIA: Tunisie-Leasing H1 gross profit.</title>
<headline>Tunisie-Leasing H1 gross profit.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian leasing company Tunisie-Leasing  LEAS.TN gross profits during the first half of 1996 amounted to 1.56 million dinars, results published on Thursday showed.</p>
<p>Figures for the same period last year were not available for comparison, but net profits for the whole of 1995 totalled 2.236 million dinars.</p>
<p>Tunisie-Leasing shares were last priced at 46.49 dinars on the Tunis Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>($=0.97 dinar)</p>
</text>
